{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "2c355ce2ce83d89f73022c16890d0322a0b64df68017df852fcf40bf560a05bf", "ja": "素直になれないcloudy heart", "zh": "无法坦率的cloudy heart", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5492507954ddb58bd43bbef371dd503f98551fdff93ae85a502b7ec9089402d0", "ja": "今までに経験したことのない友達との突然の\n別れに戸惑い、受け入れられない真美だった\nが、プロデューサーと話すことで気持ちに整\n理をつける。そんな真美に、プロデューサー\nはアイドルならではの可能性を示す。", "zh": "真美因从未经历过的朋友突然离别而不知所措，无法接受，\n但通过与制作人交谈，她整理好了自己的心情。制作人\n向这样的真美展示了只有偶像才拥有的可能性。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1000_null", "source_sha256": "de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481", "ja": "翌日……", "zh": "隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "5c29c845142f8e967e64f8285b52e3fa7907696c1fdd6d03e83690862faa2497", "ja": "真美、ほら。そろそろ帰る時間だよ。", "zh": "真美，来吧。差不多该回去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "5d384b522e87bff867b9abf92589add2ec3e525e9e728ba333911887529e36ee", "ja": "え？　あ、うん……そだね。", "zh": "诶？啊，嗯……也是呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1004_p", "source_sha256": "71750223e8f53bfc53a7ad1db28738e261b0800de0c8722a3a87a804be7ea6d6", "ja": "（真美の様子がずっとおかしい。歩たちは何か知ってる\n様子だけど……昨日の公演の後、何かあったのか？）", "zh": "（真美的样子一直很不对劲。步她们好像知道些什么……难道是昨天公演结束后发生了什么吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "c99f087b60e5519b232215e07afe86859cd23c3139f348337ecad4c3c785d682", "ja": "真美、もし体調が悪いなら家まで送るけど……。\n大丈夫か？", "zh": "真美，如果身体不舒服的话，我送你回家吧……  \n没事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "ba9a5fd701d113f118471d5bd0d67198f4f3ac1cbc94c613ad9c4214caf1fdb7", "ja": "あ、はい、大丈夫です。", "zh": "啊，嗯，我没事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1007_p", "source_sha256": "e57d4b12702f2266a3694bb22d4da555c1c0f8b833bc6c6f0e5199cc4d188d46", "ja": "なんて大丈夫じゃ無さそうなんだ……。\n一応聞くけど、新手のドッキリとかじゃないよな？", "zh": "这怎么看都不像没事的样子啊……  \n姑且问一句，不是什么新式恶作剧吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "273feac0bb249f4d649d3f8661c06062c235e29f8fcf85530abf2a73cb4d81c5", "ja": "何言ってるんですか。\nもう大人なんだから、そんなことしませんよ。", "zh": "你在说什么呢。\n都已经是大人了，才不会做那种事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1009_p", "source_sha256": "1aab49c5c7cfe642e3960a1a60dffb569c47f8a9670781e2f1935c0c0f5a17bb", "ja": "（すごい拗らせてる……）", "zh": "（真是钻牛角尖钻得厉害……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "62db5c4fc19c5f3afa911253c8d1d609210b8df7e8e85ea4dbe2f90de9b2b87a", "ja": "真美、とりあえず、着替えてきたら？\nほら、アタシ達もう着替えちゃったし……ね？", "zh": "真美，总之先去换身衣服吧？\n你看，我们都已经换好了……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1011_se", "source_sha256": "dcf0d7f4922941afaf124937bfcfce678cd2075f25517ce1d44b5d1b0a813b6a", "ja": "ガチャ……パタン", "zh": "咔哒……啪嗒", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1012_p", "source_sha256": "485f1fcde641f2be96656ba644c507c15e5ee517dc5e45c29141642063c0e5ea", "ja": "……歩、真、エレナ。\n昨日、いったい何があったんだ？", "zh": "……步、真、艾莲娜。\n昨天到底发生什么事了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4a7c107a8fbca1af5e92043ce1855e463a6dc771c2748182cb64abff5c5710c3", "ja": "う、うん。じつはね？", "zh": "嗯、嗯。其实是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1015_p", "source_sha256": "14df002d4716c5fd0a36d128483dee6b69fd3e616deb9a3cb73db80977f09d14", "ja": "なるほど。仲良くなった友達が引っ越すことを、\n突然知らされたのか……。", "zh": "原来如此。也就是说，你突然得知关系要好的朋友要搬家了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "dcb88ad43836d38506263b5c2bb2c73c7a24d9d1f9ab8487cd53ef8ce2dbf5cf", "ja": "うん……真美はここんとこ、ほとんど毎日バスケしたり\n遊んだりしててさ。ホント、すごく仲良かったんだ。", "zh": "嗯……真美最近几乎每天都和我一起打篮球、一起玩什么的。我们真的特别要好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "bd4568104f7aa367ef0336afce81dd8189e0b965eb6117e4f0183393d7f10796", "ja": "真美も頭では仕方ないって、わかってると思うんです。\nたぶん気持ちの整理ができてないだけで。", "zh": "我想真美心里也明白这是没办法的事。大概只是还没整理好自己的情绪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "c7671905ffeeb39b2c47e87ef98cc14dbc5d6ced1fb00bd6806fb2be4c7a7056", "ja": "でも……このままじゃ、ちゃんとお別れできないまま、\nアオと離れ離れになっちゃう。そんなのダメだヨ～。", "zh": "可是……这样下去，就没法好好道别，要和阿青分开了。那可不行呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1019_034ayu", "source_sha256": "99426bcf51ed05cf2cfdd795d60517066dacc71118b409a0a6e49c76bf967e3d", "ja": "それは絶対ダメってアタシも思う。最悪、\nムリにでも引っ張ってくつもり……。つもりだけど～。", "zh": "我也觉得那绝对不行。最坏的情况下，就算要硬来，我也打算把她拉走……我是这么打算的啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1020_006mak", "source_sha256": "26798ebd9b387fc464792f3b1533d6311e72c3741317b715e6561f0005e802df", "ja": "そう、ホントにムリヤリ引っ張っていけるもんじゃ\nないんだよね……真美って成長期で意外と大きいし。", "zh": "是啊，确实不是想硬拉就能拉走的……真美正处在成长期，个头也比想象中大。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1021_p", "source_sha256": "199e340afcda869442c7889a37283a87e9df9580b44b6ba7520c6e526f9676c7", "ja": "そうだろうな……。よし、とにかく、\n真美と話してみよう。呼んできてくれるか？", "zh": "是吧……嗯，总之，先和真美谈谈。能帮我把她叫来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1022_012mam", "source_sha256": "627379c065d8a827a20bbbe1750217bf3bbb8eb22c11449752706c72d1d2fe01", "ja": "別に呼びに来なくていいよ～。\nもう来てるから。", "zh": "不用特意来叫我啦～  \n我已经来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1023_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0f9855a2dadda81a31312bd6e2c97fd85e3e289feae90bbdfc80ed8eabe6e96d", "ja": "真美！", "zh": "真美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1024_006mak", "source_sha256": "0f9855a2dadda81a31312bd6e2c97fd85e3e289feae90bbdfc80ed8eabe6e96d", "ja": "真美！", "zh": "真美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1025_018ele", "source_sha256": "859defe24e687b26b0ff26837648b4cbc8bc141b900eab9d6c5a5476c16134ea", "ja": "マミ！", "zh": "真美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1026_p", "source_sha256": "3205a899176df59343f6bb669c44a69f09450aa8dce2552ad41a9c9512bd46a5", "ja": "真美……、聞いてたのか？", "zh": "真美……你都听到了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1027_012mam", "source_sha256": "7f0acf60c8cc0a6cd39132cfadc54cffe767588c1ca2b2cabe338c6879f782b0", "ja": "ううん、戻ってきたトコで聞いてない。\nけど、わかるもん。真美のこと話してたって……。", "zh": "没有，刚回来所以没听到。\n可是，真美明白的哦。你们刚才在聊真美的事吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1028_012mam", "source_sha256": "7fcdf93c2b48d984e5a6e1d2d96228947f4f4a48cefb10c56316ef9a08654017", "ja": "あゆあゆ、まこちん、えれなん。あと兄ちゃんも……\nごめんね、なんかヘンな感じになっちゃって。", "zh": "步步、真哥、艾莲娜。还有老哥也是……\n对不起，把气氛搞得怪怪的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1029_012mam", "source_sha256": "bc37af867ce48f47161dc1cfb118c9cf6ab195b3a98b3af85527ab3e410d9733", "ja": "でも、真美が一番ヘンな感じなの。アオぽんにも、\n自分にもモヤモヤして……。で、考えてたんだ。", "zh": "可是，真美才是最奇怪的那个。对アオぽん、对自己，心里都闷闷的……所以，真美一直在想这件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1030_012mam", "source_sha256": "8926184b28bcb80c68ba860e8cf18c8c389552fea466656cf1e84d3a10538793", "ja": "真美、亜美でも劇場のみんなでもない子と、\nこんなに……仲良くなったこと、あんまなくて。", "zh": "真美还是第一次和既不是亚美、也不是剧场里大家的孩子，变得这么……要好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1031_012mam", "source_sha256": "08f80886fde8e821c856fa89aad0252d421f77cb4af531dbf25a57dd201bbbce", "ja": "何か、どう仲直りしていいか、\nわかんなくなっちゃった……。", "zh": "我有点不知道该怎么和她和好才好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1032_018ele", "source_sha256": "cd8f455e534c791a80c347522c95b5e0db9266a49ce96785d56f5f398ed1e8a7", "ja": "でも……仲直りの仕方は、みんな同じじゃないノ？\nアミとの仲直りみたいにできないノ？", "zh": "不过……和好的方式，不是每个人都一样吧？\n不能像和亚美和好那样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1033_012mam", "source_sha256": "e275528016553930dd7c24cb04dd4df0e345b0d75f21e8145b734efca74c9256", "ja": "だって亜美は双子だもん。ケンカしても、転校しても、\n絶対離れ離れとかにならないもん。", "zh": "因为亚美和我是双胞胎嘛。就算吵架了，就算转学了，也绝对不会分开的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1034_012mam", "source_sha256": "a7426dd021274b9ad5b1fc23b0ddeb8645b1cb8b38c66e9462aeed723cee1a50", "ja": "でも、アオぽんはそうじゃないから。\nなくなるからさ……。", "zh": "但是，阿欧不是这样的。因为会消失嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1035_018ele", "source_sha256": "0cdfacf103e635a5b1ea09946589aacf29fd88aa2da143ab26f9bd872d0b7784", "ja": "そっか……。そうだネ。アミとは違うもんネ。", "zh": "这样啊……确实呢。毕竟和亚美不一样嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1036_006mak", "source_sha256": "3acb442c755835c4d0632c7a26b2f71c231aa36105897d21b94226108bdcf21f", "ja": "ボク達もそうだよね。ケンカしててもツアーで一緒に\n寝泊りしたりするし、ステージでも会うし。", "zh": "我们也是这样吧。就算吵架了，也会在巡演期间一起吃住，在舞台上也会见面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1037_034ayu", "source_sha256": "066a9ae32b7c4a39c712d300c53a79b12108f59afa34390155ae5bc9200fb63f", "ja": "ちょっと避けてても劇場で会うもんね……そっか。\nアオみたいな友達、真美は初めてだったんだ。", "zh": "就算稍微躲着对方，也会在剧场碰面嘛……这样啊。像アオ这样的朋友，真美还是第一次遇到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1038_p", "source_sha256": "32e219902eb315b7344abca0b9b13fa2dbe3dde7c9562ab0f6916765ee2ca6d4", "ja": "真美は、別れるのが苦手なんだろうな。\n……仲良くなるのは、あんなに得意なのに。", "zh": "真美大概不太擅长道别吧。……明明那么擅长和别人成为朋友。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1039_012mam", "source_sha256": "23e1139cb53e66fbaff5d8331364a6fc3b2560d4565dd6942acb0d27fb2b4711", "ja": "そうかも……。兄ちゃん、こういう別れを繰り返して、\nヒトは大人になっていくんだね？", "zh": "也许吧……。哥哥，人就是在一次次经历这样的离别后，慢慢长大的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1040_p", "source_sha256": "85682ccd01cb128368e599caa1dcfe72ca98b8b3ea09db74003b9902ae6bbe53", "ja": "そうだな。そうなんだけど……。\n真美はそうとも限らないかもしれない。", "zh": "是啊。虽然是这样没错……但真美或许不一定会那样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1041_012mam", "source_sha256": "a417c3e9b1360f1065202f85a4b400bd4587086cefecd437e4b009151e4d65c0", "ja": "？　どゆこと？", "zh": "？啥意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0380_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_05_1042_p", "source_sha256": "44b0eb798b73021e0ab5819c17700167f763600ef94a7c455466764d298de136", "ja": "つまり……\n真美はアイドル、ってことだ！", "zh": "也就是说……\n真美就是偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
